{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2b91acd5-f5b8-81cf-881e-5ab5ec1342ac",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T13:01:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Mensah",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:57:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:57:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I want to put up a fence and I don't know if I'm allowed. Is this the right office for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:57:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, yes. Tell me a little about the fence. What are you planning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:57:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I have a dog. He's a quick one, and he keeps slipping out of the yard when the gate's open a crack. So I want a fence to keep him in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:57:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you already have a fence, or is this all new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:57:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "New. Nothing there now. Just grass and a little hedge on one side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:57:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what material, and how tall are you thinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:57:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Vinyl. Six feet. The fella who sells it said six is what everybody gets. But how do I know that's right? Is six feet allowed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:57:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Height rules can depend on where the fence goes on the lot, front yard versus back yard, and sometimes the zone. Is this going around the back, or along the street side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:58:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Back, mostly. Maybe a piece along the side. Not the front, no."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:58:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that helps. Generally speaking, yes, a fence does need a permit here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:58:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A permit. So do I need to pull a permit before the guy starts? Or does he just do it and then I tell you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:58:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before. The permit should be in place before any work begins. Contractors usually know that, so it's worth asking him if he's planning to apply or if you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:58:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. He didn't say. Why would that be my job and not his?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:58:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can go either way. Sometimes the contractor files it, sometimes the homeowner does. Either way the property is yours, so you want to be sure it's done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:58:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so let me say that back. Permit first, then he builds. Not the other way around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:59:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:59:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what does it cost? The fee. I don't want a surprise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:59:13-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The fee depends on the fence, usually the length or the cost of the job, so I don't want to give you a number off the top of my head that turns out wrong. The application will list it, and I can have someone confirm it for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:59:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you don't know it. [pause] Well, how would I find out, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:59:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. The easiest is to come by the office or call back with your measurements and the permit staff can quote it. I can also take your number and have someone call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:59:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, let me get a pen. I'm in the middle of writing out my holiday card list by hand, and it's all over the table. Okay. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:00:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No rush. Can I get your name and a good number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:00:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tariq Mensah. M-E-N-S-A-H. The number is 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:00:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Mr. Mensah, 401-555-0183. And one more thing. A rough sketch showing where the fence sits on the property will be needed with the application. Do you have a survey or plot plan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:00:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A survey? I think there's something in a folder somewhere. Is that required? Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:00:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It shows your lot lines, so we can confirm the fence is on your property and not the neighbor's. If you can't find it, tell the staff when they call and they'll explain what else works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:00:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. So permit before work, six feet may or may not be fine depending on the spot, and somebody calls me about the fee. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You did. That's the whole picture."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:00:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm still not sure about the six feet, but I'll wait for the call. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:01:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon, and good luck with the dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:01:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
